    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m"{% if termsWithAnchors %} id="protecting-your-account" tabindex="-1"{% endif %}>Protect your account</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">Your account is for your use only. You are accountable for what you do on your account, and for what someone else does if they use your account. Everything you do in HMPPS Digital Services is linked to you.</p>
    <p class="govuk-body">Always keep your account details secure. You must never:</p>
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>share your username or password</li>
      <li>use someone else's account</li>
      <li>allow someone else to use your account</li>
      <li>leave your computer unlocked if unattended</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="govuk-body">MOJ employees, contractors, consultants and agency staff must not access HMPPS Digital Services from a non-MOJ approved device.</p>

